","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T12:24:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T12:24:29Z","body":"> How to open OpenXR Action Map editor?\r\n\r\nIf you enable OpenXR in Project Settings (XR -> OpenXR -> Enabled), it should be an option in the bottom area (by \"Output\", \"Debugger\", etc).\r\n\r\n> I created OpenXRActionMap resource, but double-clicking it in the filesystem does not open the editor.\r\n\r\nI don't know if you can edit a random OpenXRActionMap resource, the editor may only work on the one that's configured in Project Settings (XR -> OpenXR -> Default Action Map). At least, that's the only way I've ever personally used it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821164996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821223958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105624#issuecommen